This repository vendors three sets of documents under corpus/. Each keeps its
own licence. The documents are copied unmodified; the code changes them only
in memory, at load time, as described below.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
corpus/k8s-docs/
corpus/k8s-release-1.33/

Kubernetes Documentation, copyright The Kubernetes Authors, licensed CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), from kubernetes/website at
commit 0449ba43e61f8d4e97502f0902704906fba5f5d1 (2026-11-08, the v1.37 docs),
https://github.com/kubernetes/website/tree/0449ba43e61f8d4e97502f0902704906fba5f5d1/content/en/docs

What we took: the Markdown files under content/en/docs, without the two
generated folders reference/kubernetes-api and reference/instrumentation
(and without images and other non-Markdown files). The files themselves are
unmodified. Changes made at load time (src/corpus.ts): front matter is
removed, Hugo shortcodes are rendered to plain text or removed, and a feature
gate's lifecycle (its front matter "stages") is written out as a short text
block. corpus/k8s-docs/LICENSE is the upstream licence file.

corpus/k8s-release-1.33/ holds 11 pages fetched unmodified from the
release-1.33 branch of kubernetes/website on 2026-11-08 (same licence), used
only to show a stale index on real documents.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
