corpus/castlane/

Castlane is a fictional podcast-hosting company invented for this course. Its
120 documents (runbooks, postmortems, Slack channel days, ADRs, a frozen wiki
export, a handbook, a payouts report and a status page) describe no real
people or companies. Copyright (c) 2026 karnstack, licensed CC BY 4.0 (see
corpus/castlane/LICENSE). Alert names that are not Castlane's own (for
example KubePodCrashLooping) are real prometheus-operator runbook names, used
as identifiers only.
